973971_6300334187211752958_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=neUUUdUR-BIQ7kNvwHb6sMI&_nc_oc=Adr4YkR3dcybs4fMnPctpwMyOSYaRc9PzKV6I9lvHNjSge4XBo2-yKJyQBjA2qD6BGA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQOazeTrKdXIuIIAUIE0PyaDdLD6yVuKkKSVWDJd1t76ug&oe=6ACE5026"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "trailercover_2560x1440.png", "id": "763112647971999", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974914_763112651305332_1577427146239561671_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=-RsedE0a4BsQ7kNvwEbPMiy&_nc_oc=AdqDQyS9cciGqFH5kuIWlWPvXB_p11OIFn8HQetYixrELuguUJ_UUwc4ewppXgTekLs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQPsAuLZ7eLNtAXUIGsy6990j2L34Gpj4Zj7TTW0bezeeA&oe=6ACE3E9E"}, "display_name": "Unstung", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Command a swarm of cute bees as they grow & defend flowers against an army of hungry bugs.\nYou control the Queen, buzzing near bees to select them, drawing zig-zag lines through the air for the bees to follow. Help the meadow bloom by bringing pollen to flowers, making new bees, and always - protecting the hive from the evil, nosy Lord Mothmer and his bug minions!\n\nUnstung will make you feel like a really busy queen bee! You'll be buzzing and zigging all around the meadow to keep your little bees working. There are many ways to play - you could collect a huge swarm of hundreds of bees, and zoom around eliminating bugs - or you could set up a busy network of pollination to keep your flowers in tip-top shape!\n\nWell, what are you waiting for - the bees need you!", "short_description": "Command a swarm of cute bees as they grow & defend flowers against an army of hungry bugs.\nYou control the Queen, buzzing near bees to select them, drawing zig-zag lines through the air for the bees to follow. Help the meadow bloom by bringing pollen to flowers, making new bees, and always - protecting the hive from the evil, nosy L